# Nodemailer Gmail SMTP Configuration
# 1. Enable 2-Step Verification on your Google Account (myaccount.google.com/security)
# 2. Generate a 16-character App Password at: myaccount.google.com/apppasswords
# 3. Add your Gmail and the 16-char password below:

SMTP_HOST=smtp.gmail.com
SMTP_PORT=465
SMTP_SECURE=true
EMAIL_USER=anshu.priya4748@gmail.com
EMAIL_PASS=your-16-character-app-password
CONTACT_RECEIVER_EMAIL=anshu.priya4748@gmail.com
